        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana K407, Solid Brass Elongated Shell Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis oval shaped cup pull cabinet handle is great for drawers, furniture, or cabinet doors. The Elongated Shell Cabinet Handle has a total length of 4-5/8 inches and 3 inch center to center mounting.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-K407-size.gif?v=1704354767\" width=\"532\" height=\"160\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana K407 Cabinet Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/3-1-2-inch-oval-cup-cabinet-handle-deltana-k43\"><b>Oval Shell Cabinet Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-early-american-shell-cabinet-handle-deltana-shp29\"><b>Early American Shell Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana K407 Shell Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Centers: 3\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/K407.pdf?v=1704262158\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana K407 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose, the cabinet handle will still be <b>high quality solid brass</b>. \r\n</p>",
